<title>ZIMBABWE: SOCCER-ZAIRE AND ZAMBIA DRAW WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ZAIRE AND ZAMBIA DRAW WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zaire and Zambia drew 2-2 (halftime 1-1) in their World Cup soccer Africa group three qualifier in Harare on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Zaire - Etienne Sunda 29, Epole Bazamba 50</p>
<p>Zambia - Kenneth Malitoli 21, Andrew Tembo 81</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
<p> Standings  P  W  D  L  F  A  Pts:</p>
<p> Congo	   3  2  1  0  4  1  7</p>
<p> South Africa  3  1  1  1  1  2  4</p>
<p> Zaire	   3  0  2  1  3  4  2</p>
<p> Zambia	  3  0  2  1  2  3  2</p>
<p>Next matches: Zaire v South Africa, Zambia v Congo, April 27.</p>
</text>
